drm/msm/dpu: enable inline rotation on the sm8750 catalog

The four SM8750 VIG pipes get the inline-rotation feature bit and a
scaler-3.4 sub-block wired to the shared v2.01 rotation config (same
1088-line cap and format list as sm8550/sm8650 — 0340 carries the core).
Reuses the shared VIG_SM8550_MASK_SDMA and dpu_rot_sm8550_cfg_v201
rather than minting sm8750-named duplicates, following the armada merge
of the per-SoC ROCKNIX patches; content equivalent to ROCKNIX SM8750
0068 (whose SM8750-named mask and rot cfg are byte-identical copies).

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_catalog.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_catalog.c
@@ -390,6 +390,10 @@
 static const struct dpu_sspp_sub_blks dpu_vig_sblk_qseed3_3_4 =
 				_VIG_SBLK(SSPP_SCALER_VER(3, 4));
 
+static const struct dpu_sspp_sub_blks dpu_vig_sblk_qseed3_3_4_rot_v2 =
+			_VIG_SBLK_ROT(SSPP_SCALER_VER(3, 4),
+				      &dpu_rot_sm8550_cfg_v201);
+
 static const struct dpu_sspp_sub_blks dpu_vig_sblk_qseed3_3_5 =
 				_VIG_SBLK_REC0_REC1(SSPP_SCALER_VER(3, 5));
 
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/catalog/dpu_12_0_sm8750.h
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/catalog/dpu_12_0_sm8750.h
